{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1387796-storyteller-s-vault-play-it-forward-sale","id":1387796,"title":"Storyteller's Vault Play It Forward Sale","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-12T13:27:18-07:00","id":1387796,"title":"Storyteller's Vault Play It Forward Sale","content":"For those who don't know, the Storyteller's Vault (and other community content portals at DTRPG) is currently in the middle of their Play It Forward sale. In addition to reducing the prices, during this sale, 100% of the royalties will be going to the creators. Since we normally get 50%, that's double the amount of money going to the people making community content until the 17th. That means that now is an incredibly good time to pick up any Vault titles you've been thinking about.<br /> <br /> I, of course, would love it if people felt like picking up <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rand%20Brittain\" target=\"_blank\">any of my bestiaries</a>, with pre-made QCs designed for battle, currently available with Solars, Lunars, Dragon-Blooded, martial artists, sorcerers, and elementals. I hope they'll make life easier for any ST looking to put together encounters!<br /> <br /> Does anybody have any other favorite Vault content they'd like to recommend?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand